  "title": "Kung Pao Chicken Without Peanuts",
  "description": "This adaptation of the popular kung pao chicken recipe is not quite as spicy, but still has a little kick. It's great for those with nut allergies.",
  "authors": [
    "Samantha Biddlecom"
  ],
